{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263oVSuFswJa1793265582.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區股市個別發展。</p><p></p><p>日本股市連升第三日，日本央行周五召開貨幣政策會議，市場普遍預期維持利率不變。</p><p></p><p>韓國和台灣股市則終止兩連升，韓國股市曾經急挫逾百分之3，落到5,800點水平。台灣股市一度跌至46,000點邊緣。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市輕微反彈，但8,900點得而復失。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:25.070147+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T15:58:13.716523+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:26.667596+00:00","content_hash":"bad1c4b1838f2c3304ab1c46c0bba7f53a4efde133269f54053a1dae0da109e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:25.070147+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}